<h1>Your SecureMySlot account is ready</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>
  An account has been created for you after your recent booking.
</p>

<p>
  Your SecureMySlot account lets you view and manage your bookings online.
</p>

<p>
  To finish setting up your account, create a password using the link below.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Create My Password", @reset_password_url %>
</p>

<p>
  If you did not make this booking, you can ignore this email.
</p>